- At $ x = 3 $: $ 3(3)^3 - 13(3)^2 + 14(3) - 2 = 81 - 117 + 42 - 2 = 4 $

So the polynomial changes sign between 0 and 1, 1 and 2, and 2 and 3. Therefore, there are three real roots between 0 and 1, 1 and 2, and 2 and 3. Hence, all roots are real and positive.

